\section{How it works}{

The DEM is smoothed repeatedly, by averaging over square windows of
increasing size, and it is the \emph{differences between} those smoothed
versions that form the result:
\itemize{
\item The window radii come from \code{feature_min} and \code{feature_max}, converted
